#: data/levels/cinderreach/cinderreach-10.json
msgid "The Crucible"
msgstr ""

#: data/levels/greenmantle/greenmantle-03.json
msgid "The Duke and Duchess of Fennick sit on matching thrones. Matching!"
msgstr ""

#: data/levels/mirefen/mirefen-10.json
msgid "The Duke of Dampwick owns the only bridge over the bog and put a toll booth on it. My end."
msgstr ""

#: data/levels/skyreach/skyreach-04.json
msgid "The Eagle Duke's eyrie is the highest castle in the world. That's a lot of falling to do."
msgstr ""

#: data/levels/cinderreach/cinderreach-12.json
msgid "The Ember Emperor's citadel has iron walls, stone towers and a magazine the size of a barn. One of those is a weakness."
msgstr ""

#: data/levels/cinderreach/cinderreach-01.json
msgid "The Ember Margrave sent me a housewarming present. It was on fire. So was my house."
msgstr ""

#: data/levels/mirefen/mirefen-02.json
msgid "The Fen Reeve built his house on stilts so the frogs can't reach him. Neither can I. Yet."
msgstr ""

#: data/levels/cinderreach/cinderreach-06.json
msgid "The Fire Hermit lives on a pillar above the lava and throws pebbles at passing kings. I pass."
